{"id":"n40267-1-7","stage":3,"title":"너머 · 那边","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40267-1-7-1","ko":"저 언덕 너머에는 무엇이 있어?","zh":"那座山丘的另一边有什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"언덕","meaning":"坡，丘陵，山坡，山丘","explanation":"언덕：坡，丘陵，山坡，山丘。","readings":[{"term":"언덕","audio":"/audio/ddef881d90afab872b8f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15097","senseId":"1","lemma":"언덕","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언덕","audio":"/audio/ddef881d90afab872b8f.mp3"}},{"text":"너머에는","meaning":"那边，后面","explanation":"너머：那边，后面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너머","audio":"/audio/6c519bba83f7bfc573e1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40267","senseId":"1","lemma":"너머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너머에는","audio":"/audio/1f6b230c3386a90acc73.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇이","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇이","audio":"/audio/4f4c7be9c457a9adbf72.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ddef881d90afab87","term":"언덕","zh":"坡，丘陵，山坡，山丘","audio":"/audio/ddef881d90afab872b8f.mp3","entryId":"15097","definition":"像小山一样稍微倾斜，比一般的平地稍微突起的地方。","pronunciation":["언덕"]},{"id":"6c519bba83f7bfc5","term":"너머","zh":"那边，后面","audio":"/audio/6c519bba83f7bfc573e1.mp3","entryId":"40267","definition":"跨越界线或阻隔物的对面。","pronunciation":["너머"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ee8069c83ff4e231a854.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40267-1-7-2","ko":"아주 아름답고 큰 연못이 하나 있어.","zh":"那里有一个非常美丽又很大的池塘。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很。","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"아름답고","meaning":"美丽，漂亮","explanation":"아름답다：美丽，漂亮；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"아름답다","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71290","senseId":"1","lemma":"아름답다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아름답고","audio":"/audio/ed51ffd7f5005e991541.mp3"}},{"text":"큰","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰","audio":"/audio/697674905873e8eb4c58.mp3"}},{"text":"연못이","meaning":"莲池，荷塘，池塘","explanation":"연못：莲池，荷塘，池塘；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연못","audio":"/audio/1e8ce1be9b0afe49f28d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67462","senseId":"2","lemma":"연못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연못이","audio":"/audio/895e1838b92437e1ab5f.mp3"}},{"text":"하나","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dc76f888ddfaef28","term":"아주","zh":"非常，极其，很","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3","entryId":"72484","definition":"表示程度相当高，远远超出了一般程度。","pronunciation":["아주"]},{"id":"b39be518859c28e0","term":"아름답다","zh":"美丽，漂亮","audio":"/audio/b39be518859c28e09afb.mp3","entryId":"71290","definition":"对象、嗓音或颜色等令眼睛和耳朵都感到愉快和满足。","pronunciation":["아름답따"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"1e8ce1be9b0afe49","term":"연못","zh":"莲池，荷塘，池塘","audio":"/audio/1e8ce1be9b0afe49f28d.mp3","entryId":"67462","definition":"蓄水的、挖得深且宽的地方。","pronunciation":["연몯"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20279","definition":"数数时的第一个数字。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ad430578a00b2e86a2b9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.65,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40267","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"s